    "preamble": "Mansukhbhai Bhimjibhai Hingrajiya vs State Of Gujarat on 22 April, 2018 Author: B.N. Karia Bench: B.N. Karia R/Cr.Ra/516/2015 Order",
    "facts": "As such, on going through the record, it is noticed that R/CR.RA/516/2015 ORDER the offence alleged against the original accused-revisionist under the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 is not serious in nature and the punishment or penalty for such offence is not substantial, and in view of the provisions of Sections 51 and 52 of the Food Safety & Standards Act, 2006, it is Mansukhbhai Bhimjibhai Hingrajiya vs State Of Gujarat on 22 April, 2018 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/12408033/ 1 compoundable under Section 69 of the said Act.",
